msgid ""
"To complete and confirm your signature, please follow the activation "
"instructions sent to the email address you provided."
msgstr "För att färdigställa och bekräfta din signatur, vänligen följ aktiveringsinstruktionerna som har skickats till den e-postadressen som du angav."

#: templates/CRM/Campaign/Page/Petition/ThankYou.tpl
msgid "IMPORTANT"
msgstr "VIKTIGT"

#: templates/CRM/Campaign/Page/Petition/ThankYou.tpl
msgid ""
"Before we can add your signature, you must validate your email address by "
"clicking on the activation link in the confirmation e-mail. Sometimes our "
"confirmation emails get flagged as spam and are moved to your bulk folder."
msgstr "Innan vi kan lägga till din signatur, måste du validera din e-postadress genom att klicka på aktiveringslänken i bekräftelse e-post. Ibland vår bekräftelse e-post flaggas som spam och flyttas till din bulk mapp."

#: templates/CRM/Campaign/Page/Petition/ThankYou.tpl
msgid ""
"If you haven't received an email within a few minutes, please check your "
"spam folder."
msgstr "Kolla din mapp för skräp-post om du inte har tagit emot något e-postmeddelande inom ett fåtal minuter."

#: templates/CRM/Campaign/Page/Petition/ThankYou.tpl
msgid ""
"You have already signed this petition but we need to confirm your email "
"address."
msgstr "Du har redan undertecknat denna petition men vi måste bekräfta din e-postadress."

#: templates/CRM/Campaign/Page/Petition/ThankYou.tpl
msgid ""
"Before we can add your signature, you must validate your email address by "
"clicking on the activation link in the confirmation e-mail. Sometimes our "
"confirmation emails get flagged as spam and are moved to your spam folder."
msgstr "Innan vi kan lägga till din signatur, måste du validera din e-postadress genom att klicka på aktiveringslänken i bekräftelse e-post. Ibland vår bekräftelse e-post flaggas som spam och flyttas till din spam mapp."

#: templates/CRM/Campaign/Page/Petition/ThankYou.tpl
msgid ""
"If you haven't received an email from us, check your spam folder, it might "
"have been wrongly classified."
msgstr "Om du inte har fått ett e-postmeddelande från oss, kontrollera din spam-mapp, kan det ha varit felaktigt klassificerat."

